WEBVTT

00:00:00.450 --> 00:00:01.480
Hi, I'm Tobiah.

00:00:01.480 --> 00:00:03.197
Let me show you Surflo.

00:00:03.197 --> 00:00:07.316
It turns a handful of ordinary photos into one clean 3D surface.

00:00:08.850 --> 00:00:12.541
Geometry looks the same from every angle, so Surflo squeezes any number

00:00:12.541 --> 00:00:16.848
of views into one fixed latent and flows the surface points out of it.

00:00:19.050 --> 00:00:23.473
A frozen VGGT reads your unposed photos into patch tokens.

00:00:23.473 --> 00:00:27.011
A Perceiver pours them into 128 latent queries.

00:00:27.431 --> 00:00:31.688
That is the whole scene, as one fixed-size global state, whatever the view count.

00:00:32.108 --> 00:00:35.795
A flow decoder transports each query point, on its own, from

00:00:35.795 --> 00:00:37.136
noise onto the surface.

00:00:38.400 --> 00:00:39.524
Here is the formula.

00:00:40.400 --> 00:00:41.749
Each point starts as noise.

00:00:43.058 --> 00:00:44.399
It should end on the surface.

00:00:45.910 --> 00:00:49.552
The decoder only predicts the velocity that walks one to the other.

00:00:50.800 --> 00:00:56.979
The latent is always 128 tokens wide, 65,536 numbers, whether two photos

00:00:56.979 --> 00:00:59.039
go in or eighty.

00:01:00.400 --> 00:01:03.749
Independent points can disagree, so guidance makes neighbours talk near the

00:01:03.749 --> 00:01:04.967
end of the flow.

00:01:05.387 --> 00:01:07.265
First, guess where each point is heading.

00:01:07.874 --> 00:01:11.166
Render them as little Gaussians, compare to the real photos, and

00:01:11.166 --> 00:01:12.362
nudge them to match.

00:01:12.783 --> 00:01:15.634
Turn that correction into a velocity, and take the step.

00:01:16.800 --> 00:01:18.650
DL3DV surface F1.

00:01:22.850 --> 00:01:26.132
A scene is one fixed-size state; the surface is as many points

00:01:26.132 --> 00:01:27.226
as you ask for.

00:01:30.400 --> 00:01:33.960
Compress the views into one state, flow the points out, and let

00:01:33.960 --> 00:01:35.146
guidance make them agree.

00:01:35.566 --> 00:01:37.697
Every source is in the full article.

00:01:37.697 --> 00:01:38.306
I'm Tobiah.

00:01:38.306 --> 00:01:38.610
Bye!
